# The starting areas' package (Gilneas, Kezan and the Lost Isles for the Worgen and Goblins:
# warcraft/modules/mod-worgen-goblin/data/zones, its README): made by scripts/package-zones.sh from
# Cataclysm Classic's files (the build its tools/zones/common.py names, from wago.tools) with this
# converter, and published by CI as the release cata-zones-<hash> (scripts/zones-hash.sh) the app
# downloads. Kept apart from server-version.env so a change here doesn't rebuild the server.
WOTLKCONV_REPO=https://github.com/Bar3b0n3s/Converter
WOTLKCONV_COMMIT=d71523c645ebe1313e15fe47fbea57577adf8c80
